## The ConQuer-92 report — cited, with its keyword table reproduced

    H. A. Proper, "ConQuer-92 — The revised report on the conceptual query
    language LISA-D", Asymetrix Report 94-5, University of Queensland, 1994.
    arXiv:2105.11926  https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.11926

Its author distributes the report under CC BY 4.0. The report itself is not in
the repository. What is: the keyword table of its appendix B, reproduced in
`conquer/parser.py`; short quotations in the documentation, each attributed;
and `model/examples/presidents.ccm.json`, which encodes the report's running
example in this project's model format so the compiler can be checked against
the source. The changes this project made to the language are described in
`conquer/conquer-2026.md`, and the grammar as implemented is
`conquer/conquer-2026-grammar.ebnf`.


## NORMA's ORM 2 metamodel — zlib/libpng licence, fetched

    model/reference/orm-metamodel/ORM2Core.xsd
    model/reference/orm-metamodel/ORM2Root.xsd
    model/reference/orm-metamodel/ORMCoreMetaModel.orm
